(Count the words in a sentence with a table.)
Let a string be called sentence
set sentence to "the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog the end"
Let a table be called counts
set counts to empty table
for each word in split sentence by " ":
    if counts contains word:
        add 1 to counts at word
    else:
        put 1 in counts at word

Let a value be called words
set words to keys of counts
sort words
for each word in words:
    print word, ": ", counts at word
print "Most common word appears ", largest of values of counts, " times."
